# monad-emoji-nft

A tiny, fun **on‑chain Emoji NFT** you can deploy to any EVM chain (including Monad when RPC is available). It stores SVG art fully on‑chain, so no IPFS needed. One button mint, cheap gas, and kid‑friendly visuals.

