## 🚀 Quickstart

1) **Install**
```bash
npm i -D hardhat @nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox ts-node typescript dotenv
npm i @openzeppelin/contracts
npx hardhat
```
Choose "Create a TypeScript project".

2) **Drop these files in** (replace the generated ones below where names match).

3) **Set RPC + key** in `.env` (see `.env.example`) and update `hardhat.config.ts` networks.

4) **Deploy**
```bash
npx hardhat compile
npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.ts --network monad
```

5) **Mint**
```bash
npx hardhat run scripts/mint.ts --network monad
```

